 {:entry/name        "Eldar"
  :entry/type        :entry.type/race
  :entry/description "According to Elvish legend the name _Eldar_ People of the Stars was given to all the _Elves_ by the Vala _Oromë_. It came however to be used to refer only to the _Elves_ of the Three Kindreds (_Vanyar_, _Noldor_, and _Teleri_) who set out on the great westward march from _Cuiviénen_ (whether or not they remained in _Middle-earth_), and to exclude the _Avari_. See _Dark Elves_, _Úmanyar_."
  :entry/page        [10 42 47 56 117 156 173 176 177 181 192 243 285]
  :entry/appears-in  [[:chapter/name "Ainulindalë"]
                      [:chapter/name "Of the Coming of the Elves and the Captivity of Melkor"]
                      [:chapter/name "Of Eldamar and the Princes of the Eldalië"]
                      [:chapter/name "Of Fëanor and the Unchaining of Melkor"]
