 {:entry/name        "Elendil"
  :entry/type        :entry.type/character
  :entry/description "Son of _Amandil_, last lord of _Andúnië_ in _Númenor_, descended from _Eärendil_ and _Elwing_ but not of the direct line of the Kings; escaped with his sons _Isildur_ and _Anárion_ from the Drowning of _Númenor_ and founded the _Númenórean_ realms in _Middle-earth_; slain with _Gil-galad_ in the overthrow of _Sauron_ at the end of the Second Age. The name may be interpreted either as _Elf-friend_ (cf. _Elendili_) or as Star-lover."
  :entry/page        [260 263 264 267 268 278 279 280 281 282 283 285 291]
  :entry/appears-in  [[:chapter/name "Akallabêth"]
                      [:chapter/name "Of the Rings of Power and the Third Age"]]}

