 {:entry/name        "Elrond"
  :entry/type        :entry.type/character
  :entry/description "Son of _Eärendil_ and _Elwing_, who at the end of the _First Age_ chose to belong to _The Firstborn_, and remained in _Middle-earth_ until the end of the Third Age; master of _Imladris_ (_Rivendell_) and keeper of _Vilya_, the Ring of Air, which he had received from _Gil-galad_. The name means Star-dome."
